00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:09.460
I personally wasn't allowed to play video games as much as I wanted to, when I grew up.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:16.200
I think if anything it just took me longer to realize myself that I don't want video games to be the main focus in my life,

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:22.680
because I wasn't allowed to play as much as I wanted, it sorta made it like, it turned into all the focus, even when I wasn't playing.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.060
So it didn't really make any difference.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:28.620
