00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:41.780
Obviously you can be addicted to anything, and people do get addicted to gaming.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:48.380
Classifying it as a disorder, however, specifically gaming disorder, I don't know if that's necessarily helpful.

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:56.160
I think the most effective thing would to be to teach kids "Okay, work first, play later." At least that's what I'd do if I had kids.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:06.120
I know I asked this question last episode, but, I think teaching kids that attitude at a young age "okay fine, you can play video games, you can do whatever you want as long as you do your work first," right?

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.240
Makes sense, right?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:11.480
I don't know, I'm talking like it's- as if I know everything about parenting. Clearly I don't.

